{"id":"ab96223acaba295d","group":"58","path":"58/batch07/58-df-comparability.md","title":"Comparability","display":"df-comparability — Comparability","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-comparability","aliases":["58-df-comparability"],"display":"df-comparability — Comparability","depends_on":["[[../batch18/58-df-relation.md]]","[[../batch12/58-df-set.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-comparability"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-comparability</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-comparability — Comparability"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"7ccfc8c88f29968a\" href=\"?note=7ccfc8c88f29968a\" title=\"../batch18/58-df-relation.md\">../batch18/58-df-relation.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"65d9a1e690c32aad\" href=\"?note=65d9a1e690c32aad\" title=\"../batch12/58-df-set.md\">../batch12/58-df-set.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R \\subseteq A \\times A\">\\(R \\subseteq A \\times A\\)</span> (二元关系, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"7ccfc8c88f29968a\" href=\"?note=7ccfc8c88f29968a\" title=\"../batch18/58-df-relation.md\">../batch18/58-df-relation.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span> (集合, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"65d9a1e690c32aad\" href=\"?note=65d9a1e690c32aad\" title=\"../batch12/58-df-set.md\">../batch12/58-df-set.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Compar}(R, A)\">\\(\\mathrm{Compar}(R, A)\\)</span> (可比性谓词)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}comparability} \\vdash \\mathrm{Compar}(R, A) \\;\\leftrightarrow\\; R \\subseteq A \\times A \\land \\forall x,y \\in A\\;\\bigl(x \\neq y \\to (\\langle x,y\\rangle\\in R \\lor \\langle y,x\\rangle\\in R)\\bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}comparability} \\vdash \\mathrm{Compar}(R, A) \\;\\leftrightarrow\\; R \\subseteq A \\times A \\land \\forall x,y \\in A\\;\\bigl(x \\neq y \\to (\\langle x,y\\rangle\\in R \\lor \\langle y,x\\rangle\\in R)\\bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Compar}(R,A)\">\\(\\mathrm{Compar}(R,A)\\)</span> 只表示 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span> 中任意两个不同元素在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R\">\\(R\\)</span> 下可比较；它本身不是“全序”谓词。</li>\n<li>此定义仅描述可比性，不要求自反性、反对称性或传递性</li>\n<li>若要求这些性质，参见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"83dfbde66bc78255\" href=\"?note=83dfbde66bc78255\" title=\"../batch19/58-df-partial-order.md\">../batch19/58-df-partial-order.md</a> 和 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"043908345fb04de3\" href=\"?note=043908345fb04de3\" title=\"../batch20/58-df-total-order.md\">../batch20/58-df-total-order.md</a></li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch18/58-df-relation.md","status":"resolved","id":"7ccfc8c88f29968a","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch18/58-df-relation.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch12/58-df-set.md","status":"resolved","id":"65d9a1e690c32aad","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch12/58-df-set.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch18/58-df-relation.md","status":"resolved","id":"7ccfc8c88f29968a","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$R \\subseteq A \\times A$ (二元关系, see [[../batch18/58-df-relation.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch12/58-df-set.md","status":"resolved","id":"65d9a1e690c32aad","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$A$ (集合, see [[../batch12/58-df-set.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch19/58-df-partial-order.md","status":"resolved","id":"83dfbde66bc78255","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Remark]","excerpt":"若要求这些性质，参见 [[../batch19/58-df-partial-order.md]] 和 [[../batch20/58-df-total-order.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch20/58-df-total-order.md","status":"resolved","id":"043908345fb04de3","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Remark]","excerpt":"若要求这些性质，参见 [[../batch19/58-df-partial-order.md]] 和 [[../batch20/58-df-total-order.md]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"R \\subseteq A \\times A","display":false},{"tex":"A","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Compar}(R, A)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}comparability} \\vdash \\mathrm{Compar}(R, A) \\;\\leftrightarrow\\; R \\subseteq A \\times A \\land \\forall x,y \\in A\\;\\bigl(x \\neq y \\to (\\langle x,y\\rangle\\in R \\lor \\langle y,x\\rangle\\in R)\\bigr)","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Compar}(R,A)","display":false},{"tex":"A","display":false},{"tex":"R","display":false}],"bytes":1063,"backlinks":[{"id":"a11585cba9c21cfd","anchor":"ref-340","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[58-df-comparability]]"},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-324","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch07/58-df-comparability.md|58-df-comparability]]（batch07）"}],"outgoing":["7ccfc8c88f29968a","65d9a1e690c32aad","83dfbde66bc78255","043908345fb04de3"]}